==Description==
The '''Dark Frost Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 29 of the regular [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|990}} or {{Robux|133}} ({{Robux|106}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|13,095}} or {{Robux|2,855}} ({{Robux|2,272}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

The '''Dark Frost Nametag''' has light with green gradient text and outline. Behind the text, snowfall and dark purple smokes can be seen.

